#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:13
#: 35389903e42844f29cd4cc4d9d6b9f3f
msgid ""
"These nodes allow existing ArduPilot supported peripherals to be adapted to "
"the CAN bus as DroneCAN or MSP devices. This also allows for extending the "
"capabilities of the autopilot hardware. Such as allowing I2C devices (e.g. a"
" compass or airspeed) to be located more than 1 meter from the autopilot and"
" enabling up to 32 servo output channels."
msgstr ""
"这些节点允许将 ArduPilot 现有支持的外设作为 DroneCAN 或 MSP 设备适配到 CAN 总线上。这还可以扩展飞控硬件的能力，例如允许 "
"I2C 设备（如罗盘或空速计）位于距飞控超过 1 米的位置，并支持最多 32 个舵机输出通道。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:17
#: 7fe3501b45084688a9cb2e722e383c47
msgid ""
"They utilize the `AP_Periph "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/AP_Periph>`__ "
"library to use existing ArduPilot drivers on a supported hardware board. "
"Translating UART, SPI, I2C, or GPIO-based peripheral devices supported by "
"ArduPilot into DroneCAN devices on the CAN bus or MSP."
msgstr ""
"它们利用 `AP_Periph "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/AP_Periph>`__ "
"库在支持的硬件板上使用现有 ArduPilot 驱动程序，将 ArduPilot 支持的 UART、SPI、I2C 或 GPIO 接口外设转换为 CAN"
" 总线上的 DroneCAN 设备或 MSP 设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:19
#: 0a8dec5e049440658d36fbf64cfde7d8
msgid ""
"This provides an easy method to develop integrated DroneCAN peripherals "
"which can be used with ArduPilot or other systems that support DroneCAN."
msgstr "这提供了一种简便的方法来开发集成 DroneCAN 外设，可与 ArduPilot 或其他支持 DroneCAN 的系统配合使用。"

