msgid ""
"DroneCAN Adapters can support various devices and configurations. Often, its"
" configuration parameters will need to be altered. To achieve this, either "
"use :ref:`DroneCAN GUI<common-uavcan-gui>` or :ref:`MissionPlanner SLCAN "
"<planner:dronecan-uavcan-slcan>` to change the device's parameters."
msgstr ""
"DroneCAN 适配器可支持多种设备和配置。通常需要修改其配置参数。为此，请使用 :ref:`DroneCAN GUI<common-uavcan-"
"gui>` 或 :ref:`MissionPlanner SLCAN <planner:dronecan-uavcan-slcan>` 更改设备参数。"

