msgid ""
"The first adapter was manufactured by `mRobotics "
"<https://store.mrobotics.io/product-p/mro10042.htm>`__, is shown below, and "
"provides socketed outputs for a UART+I2C and another I2C connection, and "
"solder pads for a second UART, SPI bus, GPIOs, and ADC inputs."
msgstr ""
"第一个适配器由 `mRobotics <https://store.mrobotics.io/product-p/mro10042.htm>`__ "
"生产，如下图所示，提供用于 UART+I2C 和另一路 I2C 连接的插座输出，以及用于第二路 UART、SPI 总线、GPIO 和 ADC "
"输入的焊盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-adapter-node.rst:140
#: e1caf859ca2046d2bc1cdb0e1d94da05
msgid ""
"The first generation was based on the f103 processor, while the current "
"generation uses an f303 for more memory, allowing more peripheral options to"
" be accommodated simultaneously in the firmware. The L431 processor is now "
"supported, as well as any ArduPilot compatible autopilot can be adapted for "
"use as a DroneCAN Adapter Node."
msgstr ""
"第一代基于 f103 处理器，而当前一代使用 f303 以获得更大内存，从而在固件中同时支持更多外设选项。现已支持 L431 处理器，以及任何兼容 "
"ArduPilot 的飞控均可适配为 DroneCAN 适配器节点。"
